://zzapp.gsxt.gov.cn/ebl/instruction.html\" target=\"_blank\">电子营业执照使用说明</a>\n                                </span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"load-ktishi4-1-xyb\" style=\"display: none;text-align: center;line-height: 35px; font-size: 12px; color:#666;\"><span>请使用湘易办APP扫一扫功能扫码</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"load-k4-1\"><span>其他登录方式</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"load-k4-2-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a style=\"cursor: pointer;\" onclick=\"gjzhdl()\">国家政务服务平台账号登录</a><span>|</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a style=\"cursor: pointer;\" id=\"dlfs\" onclick=\"dzyyzzdl()\">电子营业执照登录</a><span>|</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a style=\"cursor: pointer;\" id=\"szzsdl\" onclick=\"szzscadl()\">数字证书CA登录</a><!--<span>|</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a style=\"cursor: pointer;\" id=\"xybappfr\" onclick=\"xybappFr()\" >湘易办登录</a>-->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <div class=\"load-k4-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a style=\"cursor: pointer;\" onclick=\"gjzhdl()\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/dlxg1_03.png\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>国家政务服务平台账号登录</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a style=\"cursor: pointer;\" onclick=\"gjzhdl()\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/dlxg1_03.png\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>国家政务服务平台账号登录</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"login-r1\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: center;color: #666;\">登录、注册遇到问题？请进入<a href=\"http://zwfw-new.hunan.gov.cn/hnzwfw/public/2020/help.html\" style=\"\ncolor: red;padding: 0 5px;text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\">帮助中心</a></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<script src=\"https://zwfw-new.hunan.gov.cn/hnzwfw/zwfw4/foot.js?v=3.0\" charset=\"gbk\"></script><div class=\"foot2020\">  <div class=\"ss_main\">   <div class=\"foot2020-1 clearfix\">    <div class=\"fne-l1\">     <ul class=\"clearfix\">      <li class=\"li0\" 